Steps for sentence completion in IELTS reading.

7
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:28,290
Part 3.

8
00:00:29,210 --> 00:00:29,820
Practice.

9
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:33,690
This lesson aims to help you understand the

10
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:36,170
format of sentence completion in IELTS reading.

11
00:00:36,890 --> 00:00:40,390
Remember, understand and apply steps for sentence completion

12
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:41,390
in IELTS reading.

13
00:00:41,990 --> 00:00:45,150
Practice sentence completion in IELTS reading with the

14
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:47,130
